|!
!|!
!|10000$SENV(PUSH)$    Save RIPscrip environment settings
!|J10                   Set base math to MegaNums (base 36)
!|n2000|!               Set 2 byte X/Y coordinates
!|M08|!                 Set color palette mode
!|fZKQO                 Set world coordinats to 1280x960
!|2p0000|!              Delete all ports (screen is unaffected)
!|2P10000ZKQO00010000|! Create port #1 to be full screen sized
!|10000$SENV(POP$      Restore RIPscrip environment settings
